{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01016","headline":"横吹曲辞 紫骝马 · 秦韬玉","name":"横吹曲辞 紫骝马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渥洼奇骨本难求，况是豪家重紫骝。\n臕大宜悬银压銙，力浑欺却玉衔头。\n生狞弄影风随起，躞蹀冲尘汗满沟。\n若遇丈夫皆调御，任从骑取觅封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦韬玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}